{"logId": "08e8dc80-f9a1-4013-87c0-03a141dc67f9", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）", "block_bbox": [320, 121, 888, 165], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[320.0, 121.0], [888.0, 121.0], [888.0, 165.0], [320.0, 165.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "五级【4~5分】：彼此尊重、彼此独立、没有束缚和包袱，各自活好自己阳光的生命。（自由）", "block_bbox": [310, 231, 1439, 264], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[310.0, 231.0], [1439.0, 231.0], [1439.0, 264.0], [310.0, 264.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：父母与子女之间是平等的人格和独立自由的个体，彼此毫无束缚地去过自己的生活，社会的个体属性大于家庭的情感属性。", "block_bbox": [309, 298, 1543, 376], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[309.0, 298.0], [1543.0, 298.0], [1543.0, 376.0], [309.0, 376.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [311, 441, 482, 473], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[311.0, 441.0], [482.0, 441.0], [482.0, 473.0], [311.0, 473.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、不干涉彼此生活，彼此自由又彼此深爱、相互关心和挂念，没有彼此的负担和压力", "block_bbox": [335, 500, 1331, 532], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 500.0], [1331.0, 500.0], [1331.0, 532.0], [335.0, 532.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、引导父母学会照顾自己，不拖累别人，不给别人添麻烦", "block_bbox": [336, 544, 1018, 576], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 544.0], [1018.0, 544.0], [1018.0, 576.0], [336.0, 576.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、面对父母疾病、理性科学对待，做好合理妥善的安排；对于恶性情况，坦然面对，不强行干预和过度治疗，造成延续的痛苦", "block_bbox": [335, 589, 1541, 665], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 589.0], [1541.0, 589.0], [1541.0, 665.0], [335.0, 665.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、能够引导父母乐观阳光的死亡观（活着时尽情享受，死了也从容安详的状态，无感的生命）", "block_bbox": [336, 677, 1419, 709], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 677.0], [1419.0, 677.0], [1419.0, 709.0], [336.0, 709.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、能够正确认知死亡，假使面对父母离开，不是毫无节制的痛苦，而是理解、乐观地送别和祝福", "block_bbox": [335, 721, 1464, 753], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 721.0], [1464.0, 721.0], [1464.0, 753.0], [335.0, 753.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[60]", "block_bbox": [914, 968, 957, 993], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[914.0, 968.0], [956.0, 968.0], [956.0, 992.0], [914.0, 992.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.9017012715339661, "coordinate": [320, 121, 888, 165], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[320.0, 121.0], [888.0, 121.0], [888.0, 165.0], [320.0, 165.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8437372446060181, "coordinate": [310, 231, 1439, 264], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[310.0, 231.0], [1439.0, 231.0], [1439.0, 264.0], [310.0, 264.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9330123066902161, "coordinate": [309, 298, 1543, 376], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[309.0, 298.0], [1543.0, 298.0], [1543.0, 376.0], [309.0, 376.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.843295156955719, "coordinate": [311, 441, 482, 473], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[311.0, 441.0], [482.0, 441.0], [482.0, 473.0], [311.0, 473.